      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْمِىٌّ</span></b>  [<i>Of,</i> or <i>relating to, a name</i> or <i>noun</i> or
<i>substantive;</i>] rel. n. from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْمٌ</span>; as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِمَوِىٌّ</span></b> 
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُمَوِىٌّ</span></b> . (S, TA.) [Hence, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُمْلَةٌ ٱسْمِيَّةٌ</span> <i>A
nominal proposition</i> or <i>phrase;</i> as distinguished
from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِعْليَّةٌ</span>, or verbal.]

